  "version": "0.1.33-beta-test",
  "prepared_at_utc": "2026-10-22T21:05:27+00:00",
  "changes": [
    "Correct native tube inventory binding with ref IPlayableCharacter argument delivery, verify actual stored inventory actor, and close inventory on mismatch before crew orders. Covers loading, load-and-maintain and separate maintenance. Preserve native eligibility and scoped handoff; no global fallback."
  ],
  "validation": {
    "compile": "passed",
    "offline": "failed",
    "in_game": "not-run",
    "notes": [
      "Supplied-reference compilation passed. 445 targeted offline assertions passed (316 UI/depth/viewing/MP + 129 cleanup/navigation/handoff/binding). New tests invoke actual typed prefix by reference and pass its result to interface-typed inventory Open, then verify stored actor and mismatch close. Overall offline status FAILED: separate real Harmony 2.2.2 probe under container CoreCLR 8 crashed with SIGSEGV; no actual Harmony integration pass is claimed. Probe is excluded. No live .33 run. ZIP CRC/source equality/Workshop ID verified."
    ]
  },
  "known_issues": [
    "Real game Harmony/Unity/MP and native role eligibility need live validation; .32 owner log showed actual inventoryActor=null despite edited diagnostic arguments. .33 typed ref fix unverified in-game. Separate host probe failure preserved in validation status. Prior exit crash, physical aft door mismatch and supplied-log rendering CullingResults exception not fixed. No physics/depth/config/TRC9 changes or release/merge/Workshop upload."
  ],
